@baseUrl = http://localhost:8555
@adminToken = replace-with-an-admin-jwt

### Submit a volunteer application (creates a database row)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example Volunteer",
  "email": "example.volunteer@example.com",
  "role": "Research & Education",
  "message": "I would like to help with educational materials."
}

### List applications (requires an Admin JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/volunteers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
